{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c13c1cab2ed216c39d74ac506883c8b05b6f84e8564922a9f517b6742f96010f", "ja": "はい、モニターはそこにお願いします。\nハンドマイクはこっちに置いて……。", "zh": "是，萤幕请放在那边。\n手持麦克风放在这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1001_p", "source_sha256": "4f14d5ec7234d1fc32e1ad50a196e91c53d039d496f3ab415f9570b0aea685b9", "ja": "（のり子の初ステージまで、あと数日……。\nステージの準備もだいぶ整ってきた。いよいよだな）", "zh": "（距离法子的首场表演还有几天……\n舞台的相关准备也大致完成，日子终于要到了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "39e9ed075c76cfe2dbaedc43b6bcaef3498de1ea9e373d0802e45b37ccf1f2d7", "ja": "あそこが、アタシのリング……\nあのリングに、この衣装で上がるのか……。", "zh": "那边就是我的擂台……\n我要穿这套服装，登上那座擂台吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ef38fb65863a4dafdec076779ab01bf97080dc22c842cdd4813104ef38509a84", "ja": "そうだな。確かにセッティング中のステージは、\n戦いの場に見えなくもないけど……。", "zh": "是啊。还在设置中途的舞台，\n看起来或许真有点像战场，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4f6b46a7d79fead4f2ebaa35a9882704b1cd9243d4b5c2d45a7c5616a9cf42d8", "ja": "あそこに上がるのは、その衣装ののり子で\n間違いないぞ。……よく似合ってるじゃないか。", "zh": "要站上那里的人，就是穿着这套服装的法子，\n这是无庸置疑的……你穿起来很适合嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "62d94e4a2d5983165bca5f886dccfbf3219f9cf4d6b68cd20d39afedfe18ad5e", "ja": "えっ！\n……ほ、本当に！？", "zh": "什么！？\n……真、真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8f76935254cc693d120839d541d55fc8e932868d51aa38f3ab2325aeda061db0", "ja": "ああ、本当だよ。\n……何でそんなに驚いてるんだ？", "zh": "对，真的。\n……你干嘛这么吃惊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "15761a2aba98b6220a4e6bf813a8ad39bb5780698a00374786f913f3a82b2681", "ja": "だって……鏡で今の自分を見た時、ラリアットを\n食らったみたいに、頭がくらくらしたんだよね。", "zh": "因为……我刚才照镜子的时候，\n感觉就像吃了一记金臂勾，头昏脑胀的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1623468407f10ebecddd8a781dcffa8df754d4341f6fb0916ef58c38cf546fb4", "ja": "えっ？　食らったことがあるのか？", "zh": "等等？你被金臂勾打过？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "72bd3736fae89b2bb17ac756cdf3ee6c21d4d766c447689409d94f119d1cf465", "ja": "あるよ？　小さい頃、兄貴とプロレスで\n遊んでた時に……って、そういう話じゃなくて！", "zh": "对啊！小时候，\n我和我哥玩摔角时……不对，我不是要讲这个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "d529f11701a29d91174f34e6c798f22a04dd440e9e93cdc623e16c0013e5c9e8", "ja": "……あのさ、どこもおかしくない？\nどこか変だったら、ちゃんと言って！", "zh": "……我问你，我看起来真的不会怪怪的吗？\n要是有哪里不对劲，你一定要讲哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "08aed350905efbf746efb3ec3fe13f8a74f82f3cb77a91f85188b4054c520d2f", "ja": "おかしくないって言ってもらわないと、\nアタシ、ステージに立てないよ……！", "zh": "你要确认好我没有奇怪的地方，\n不然我不敢上台啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "89e8966d78452135e3c981686ea0268ba60860af4202fcdcea4bb81e805feb18", "ja": "のり子はどこもおかしくないし、\n自信を持っていい。", "zh": "法子，你一点都不奇怪，\n拿出自信吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2a63d51bcc7b5ee71c5218c3e0dadb230ef208ca8eb26bdae8cf5cb3985791e3", "ja": "レッスンも頑張ってるし、大丈夫。\nきっと、あのリング…いや、ステージの上でも輝ける！", "zh": "你在训练课时都很努力，没问题的。\n在那座擂台……不，在那座舞台上你一定也能发光发热！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "73028a4cf5711af56d267138619ff01e9e27a7eea22d84d22af638e41cc7a26a", "ja": "も、もう！　{$P$}、\n今はそういうのが聞きたいんじゃないんだってば！", "zh": "真、真是的！{$P$}，\n我现在想听的不是这个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "1a231ef900159ed7d00e53ab93ba6392b8f72c5a41acc0ef3f6f278c382e9776", "ja": "えっ？\nえーと……じゃあ、なんて言えば？", "zh": "咦？\n呃……不然，我该说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b7eb996850a49db6e9218dbfe502479915b63dcd071199ee62553dec5375eba", "ja": "っ……そ、それは……。", "zh": "唔……就、就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "3e3bce83bad3ae00c04f9dca2533ae5acf8008cf10fa6728146abc42b3a026fa", "ja": "……自信が、ないから！\nか、可愛いって、言って！", "zh": "……我没有、自信！\n你、你要夸我、可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_1020", "source_sha256": "8b1a9a533bdfdca56281a9d8be7b247139a5ab6e00239c8e1bc06fe1e5a545bc", "ja": "可愛い", "zh": "你很可爱", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4e051bc602282312f6bc03050cd73ce4e8ddd86a79940efe3213c6d6ab05d1a4", "ja": "ごめん、当たり前すぎて言いそびれてた。\n……すごく可愛いよ。", "zh": "抱歉，因为太理所当然，我忘记讲了。\n……你很可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2001_043nor", "source_sha256": "4fffa1d4ddb27eeba171b47efbc6581b440d028d2d90129e7a06b2bd78b5cbd9", "ja": "……信じていい？", "zh": "……我可以相信你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "de9d16234af1437e7c59b94b8101997b769e91b68df631dce234d1a678a70dc5", "ja": "もちろん。", "zh": "当然可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2003_043nor", "source_sha256": "0cc8ef0fddbae56df0156ae6870be47d8c98fa15610e41065353fcfed34845ab", "ja": "無理矢理、言わせたんじゃない？", "zh": "你不是被我逼着讲的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e8422b138216f54a9477bd06e5bf1360cfc258ad2f50c8e4d3fd3956def8de1d", "ja": "言わされてない。\n本心だから。", "zh": "我没有被逼。\n我是发自内心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2005_043nor", "source_sha256": "d86d379b519420a9bd2e9c9a529d7d1782e2cac88c14c39920f6329da4702bc7", "ja": "……わかった。\n{$P$}がそこまで言うなら、信じる。", "zh": "……好吧。既然{$P$}\n都说得这么肯定，我就相信你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2006_043nor", "source_sha256": "90a9eb6afb5236fab67a70e7d5ccb1568cbe2e097b8073d42246b36051c3d5b8", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとう。\nちゃんと……心をこめて、言ってくれて。", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你。\n谢谢你……发自内心称赞我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "fc6cc215a65f0905924a74ec7132e586efdf7ea93e465a3301cbe5a2b4d02b03", "ja": "のり子……。", "zh": "法子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2008_043nor", "source_sha256": "51a4bc5df29a0d67efaf69620c4a45f48c27b1285104d7fbf7aaae9c8e95cb7f", "ja": "ううっ、照れくさい……！\n恥ずかしくて死んじゃいそう！", "zh": "呜呜，好难为情……！\n我快要害羞死了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2009_043nor", "source_sha256": "e7509d07b117fc196d40c813965b0830b7d978f5a6b269ab43315848cf7970b9", "ja": "あ、あの！　アタシ、これからレッスンだから\n……行ってくるね！", "zh": "不、不好意思！我接下来还要上训练课程，\n……先走了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "7b6522558eff46062e84f6faa829ca16d4f753a4005b13b2d12c8a03fcedd965", "ja": "ああ、いってらっしゃい。", "zh": "好，路上小心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2011_043nor", "source_sha256": "9117393f830b2c8996f27dd6c94ed13177c73d10f96679c6eda88c32368773e7", "ja": "さ、さっきの……\n本番の前にも、もう1回言ってくれる？", "zh": "刚、刚才那些话……\n可以在正式演出之前再对我说一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "30a8ababc7af592bb84383f9c7b60b379d4c023f96a890f276edab5c3f2bf65a", "ja": "もちろん。\n本当のことだし、必要なら何度でも！", "zh": "当然没问题。\n毕竟是事实嘛，有需要的话要我说几次都行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2013_043nor", "source_sha256": "cf31e354a0f2b2d2ba11f7cbbb32e53ce6b71c25a634c12daa9b1f15282a772a", "ja": "そ、そんな、何回も言わなくてもいいけど……\nわかった、期待してるね！", "zh": "其、其实，也不用讲那么多次啦……\n好，那我等着听你讲啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "5ceab24c59855e27e0ac5097147dad8e92858899463a96c3dc1bcba44c5e1ad0", "ja": "（小さくガッツポーズを決めながら駆けていく。\n……本番前には、ちゃんと言葉で伝えるとしよう）", "zh": "（法子微微扬拳做出胜利姿势，一边跑走了。\n……正式演出之前，我要好好跟她说。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_043nor_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_043nor_003_2015_p", "source_sha256": "3839625e5b22fa0ab66f9ffdf59ac14c22540629b52a778859facb5cd2164966", "ja": "（そういう後ろ姿も、すごく可愛いかった、って）", "zh": "（说她那样跑走的背影，也非常可爱。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
